WEBVTT

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:08.350
<i>This is a story about something that happened 189 years before now.</i>

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.440
<i>The star Hydrus Beta went supernova and caused incredible damage...</i>

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:48.880
<i>...even on the Earth, twenty light years away.</i>

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.880
<i>A green-colored universe,enveloped in gas.</i>

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:00.300
<i>That is the color of the universe that I know.</i>

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:04.220
<i>But I want to see it.</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.390
<i>The color of the universe that people from long ago could see...</i>

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>...when they looked up from the Earth.</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.940
<i>That's why I'm going to the Stellvia.</i>

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.970
<i>Right now, it's the year 2356...</i>

